rt a conversation</span></a><details class=\"nav__mobile\"><summary class=\"nav__burger\" aria-label=\"Navigation menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu nav__burger-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x nav__burger-close\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"nav__sheet\" aria-label=\"All pages\"><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Services</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/devsecops\">Secure SDLC<span class=\"nav__sheet-blurb\">The page that explains why one firm does both. Start here.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/software-development\">Software Development</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\">Engagement Models</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services\">All <!-- -->services</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Industries</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/financial-services\">Financial Services</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/healthcare\">Healthcare</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/saas\">SaaS &amp; Technology</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/logistics\">Logistics</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/public-sector\">Public Sector</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/retail\">Retail &amp; Payments</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries\">All <!-- -->industries</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Proof</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Anatomy of a report<span class=\"nav__sheet-blurb\">Walk a real deliverable, redacted. See what actually lands in your inbox.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Resources</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/resources\">All resources</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/tools\">Open-source tools</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/methodologies\">Methodologies</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Company</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md btn--full\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"nav__sheet-hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\">Incident response, 24/7 — <!-- -->+44 20 4525 9100</a></div></nav></details></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cloud-security#service\",\"name\":\"Cloud Security\",\"serviceType\":\"Cloud Security\",\"description\":\"The identity graph, not the misconfiguration list.\",\"disambiguatingDescription\":\"Identity-path analysis across AWS, Azure and GCP, not a CSPM findings dump.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cloud-security\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":[{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"Bangladesh\"}],\"audience\":{\"@type\":\"BusinessAudience\",\"name\":\"Regulated organisations\"},\"category\":\"Cybersecurity\",\"hasOfferCatalog\":{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Cloud Security — what is included\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalogItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Identity and access review\",\"description\":\"IAM policies, trust relationships, permission boundaries, SCPs, and every path from an assumable identity to a privileged one.\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalogItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Network and perimeter\",\"description\":\"VPC design, security groups, NACLs, private endpoints, egress control, and what is actually reachable from the internet versus what you believe is.\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalogItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Data protection\",\"description\":\"Encryption at rest and in transit, KMS key policies, and who can decrypt what through which role chain.\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalogItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Workload security\",\"description\":\"Container images, Kubernetes RBAC and admission control, serverless execution roles, and metadata service access from compute.\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalogItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"CI/CD and supply chain\",\"description\":\"Pipeline identities, OIDC federation to your repository provider, artefact signing, and the branch protection that stands between a pull request and production.\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalogItem\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Detection coverage\",\"description\":\"What your current logging would and would not have caught, mapped against MITRE ATT&CK for Cloud.\"}]},\"termsOfService\":\"https://envenox.com/legal/terms\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Envenox\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Services\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/services\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Cybersecurity\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cybersecurity\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Cloud Security\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cloud-security\"}]}</script><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" style=\"padding-top:calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--s16))\" aria-labelledby=\"service-h1\"><div class=\"u-container\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-hero__eyebrow\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services\">Services</a> · <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a></p><h1 id=\"service-h1\" class=\"sv-h1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-4px;margin-right:var(--s3);color:var(--accent)\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg>Cloud Security</h1><p class=\"sv-sub\">The identity graph, not the misconfiguration list.</p><p class=\"sv-cred\"><strong class=\"sv-cred__figure\">11 of 14 cloud reviews</strong><span class=\"sv-cred__context\">found at least one path from a low-privilege identity to full account administrator</span></p><div class=\"sv-hero__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a href=\"#enquiry-form\" class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\"><span>Send an enquiry</span></a></div><ul class=\"sv-hero__meta\"><li>3 weeks per cloud estate, verification at week 6.</li><li>Fixed-scope review, or continuous posture monitoring as part of an MDR retainer.</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"problem\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s6)\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">The problem</p><h2 id=\"problem\" class=\"sv-h2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">The identity graph, not the misconfiguration list.</h2></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><p class=\"sv-prose-measure\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:var(--text-lg);color:var(--muted-strong)\">Cloud security posture tools produce a list of misconfigurations ranked by a vendor severity that does not know your architecture. The question that matters is different and harder: from any identity an attacker could plausibly obtain, what is reachable? We build the identity graph for your accounts — human users, service principals, CI roles, instance profiles, cross-account trust, OIDC federation — and we trace the paths. A public S3 bucket is a finding. A CI role that can assume a production deployment role that can read the KMS key that decrypts the customer database is an incident waiting for a leaked token, and no posture tool will rank it first.</p><div style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s3)\" id=\"frameworks\">Frameworks we work to</p><ul class=\"sv-chips\" aria-label=\"Frameworks and standards\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">CIS Benchmarks</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">AWS Well-Architected Security Pillar</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Cloud</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">NIST SP 800-204</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"consoles\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">The working surface</p><h2 id=\"consoles\" class=\"sv-h2\">What this looks like in operation</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Drawn, not screenshotted. These stand in for platforms we operate and do not own, so the data is illustrative — but the density, the columns and the decisions on them are the real ones.</p></div><div class=\"sv-consoles\"><div class=\"dg-console\"><div class=\"dg-consoleSay\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Coverage, not configuration</p><h3 class=\"dg-consoleTitle\">A fleet view that reports delivery, not green ticks</h3><p class=\"dg-consoleBody\">The single most common gap we find is a source that is configured and not arriving. A console that shows configured status will show it green for years; this one reports per-host agent state and last check-in, which is the thing that is actually true.</p></div><div class=\"dg-consoleArt\"><figure data-reveal=\"\" class=\"product_figure__CFsTQ\"><div class=\"product_console__JtIC_\"><div class=\"product_titlebar__rns9g\"><span class=\"product_titleGroup__MMGDe\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-laptop product_titleIcon__O6a8i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.526a2 2 0 0 0 .212.897l1.068 2.127a1 1 0 0 1-.9 1.45H3.62a1 1 0 0 1-.9-1.45l1.068-2.127A2 2 0 0 0 4 15.526V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M20.054 15.987H3.946\"></path></svg><span class=\"product_title__jwaL7\">Managed EDR — Fleet</span><span class=\"product_tenant__pmMjS\">Northwind Logistics Group<!-- --> · <span class=\"u-mono\">nwl-prod</span></span></span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">48</span> of<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">1,284</span> <!-- -->endpoints</span></div><div class=\"product_toolbar__r0M90\"><span class=\"product_count__QBcJS\">Filter <span class=\"u-mono\">subnet:<!-- -->10.42.18.0/24</span> +<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono\">10.42.26.0/23</span></span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_chipRow__xIuJh\"><span class=\"product_legendItem__rbLW6\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevCritical__qnAYH\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Status<!-- -->: </span>Detection</span><span class=\"product_chipCount__IT0BR u-mono u-tnum\">2</span></span><span class=\"product_legendItem__rbLW6\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevHigh__aqAna\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Status<!-- -->: </span>Isolated</spa