an class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Info</span></span><span class=\"product_treeFacts__siO9b\"><span class=\"product_treeFact__fP2Gy\"><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">sha256</span> <span class=\"u-mono\">1f6c8ba02de74913<!-- -->…</span></span><span class=\"product_treeFact__fP2Gy\"><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">signer</span> <!-- -->Microsoft Windows — valid</span></span><span class=\"product_tipWrap__7J35E\"><span class=\"product_tipTrigger___L_7_ u-mono\" tabindex=\"0\">\\??\\C:\\Windows\\system32\\conhost.exe 0xffffffff -ForceV1</span><span class=\"product_tip__zivWH u-mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\\??\\C:\\Windows\\system32\\conhost.exe 0xffffffff -ForceV1</span></span></div></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y product_treeFootnote__fywRE\">Command lines are truncated to one line. The full string is shown on hover and on keyboard focus; SHA-256 digests are truncated to the first 16 hex characters, as the console renders them.</p></div><div class=\"product_verdict__bReey\"><span class=\"product_verdictHead__uYXXj\"><span class=\"product_verdictLabel__rB0nq\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-ban\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m4.243 5.21 14.39 12.472\"></path></svg> Containment executed</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-10-14<!-- --> <!-- -->13:54:02<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">K. Osei<!-- --> — <!-- -->Senior analyst, Envenox SOC</span></span><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\"><strong class=\"product_strong__md3es\">Network isolation — management channel retained</strong> on<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono\">NWL-WS-2290</span>, <!-- -->1 m 43 s from detection<!-- -->.<!-- --> <!-- -->Pre-authorised under MSA-4471 Schedule 3 §2.4 (contain-first)<!-- -->.</p><div><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">Artefacts captured before isolation</p><dl class=\"product_kv__qZr9Y\"><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Memory image</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">NWL-WS-2290-20261014T135358Z.lime</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Dropped DLL</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">a3f1c9e4b27d8054 · 184,320 bytes</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Netflow slice</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">13:51:08 → 13:54:02 UTC</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Isolation lifted</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS\"><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1\"></path></svg> Not yet — host stays isolated pending client rebuild</span></dd></div></dl></div></div></div></div><div class=\"product_statusbar__oc8me\"><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg>Agent <span class=\"u-mono\">enxagent 6.4.2</span> on<!-- --> <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R u-mono u-tnum\">45</span> <!-- -->of <!-- -->48</span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Telemetry gap threshold <span class=\"u-mono\">4 h</span></span><span class=\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Containment mandate <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">contain-first</span></span></div></div><figcaption class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Representative view of the managed EDR fleet console used during a cloud and endpoint coverage review. Illustrative data — not a client estate.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"included\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Scope</p><h2 id=\"included\" class=\"sv-h2\">Where the line is</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">What we will not test is as important as what we will, so both are on the same page rather than one of them in an appendix.</p></div><figure class=\"dg dg-scope\"><div class=\"dg-scopeIn\"><p class=\"dg-scopeTag u-mono\">Inside the boundary<span class=\"dg-scopeCount\">6 surfaces</span></p><ol class=\"dg-scopeGrid\"><li class=\"dg-scopeCell\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><h3 class=\"dg-scopeName\">Identity and access review</h3><p class=\"dg-scopeBody\">IAM policies, trust relationships, permission boundaries, SCPs, and every path from an assumable identity to a privileged one.</p></li><li class=\"dg-scopeCell\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span><h3 class=\"dg-scopeName\">Network and perimeter</h3><p class=\"dg-scopeBody\">VPC design, security groups, NACLs, private endpoints, egress control, and what is actually reachable from the internet versus what you believe is.</p></li><li class=\"dg-scopeCell\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><h3 class=\"dg-scopeName\">Data protection</h3><p class=\"dg-scopeBody\">Encryption at rest and in transit, KMS key policies, and who can decrypt what through which role chain.</p></li><li class=\"dg-scopeCell\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><h3 class=\"dg-scopeName\">Workload security</h3><p class=\"dg-scopeBody\">Container images, Kubernetes RBAC and admission control, serverless execution roles, and metadata service access from compute.</p></li><li class=\"dg-scopeCell\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span><h3 class=\"dg-scopeName\">CI/CD and supply chain</h3><p class=\"dg-scopeBody\">Pipeline identities, OIDC federation to your repository provider, artefact signing, and the branch protection that stands between a pull request and production.</p></li><li class=\"dg-scopeCell\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">06</span><h3 class=\"dg-scopeName\">Detection coverage</h3><p class=\"dg-scopeBody\">What your current logging would and would not have caught, mapped against MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Cloud.</p></li></ol></div></figure></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"methodology\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">The Adversary Loop</p><h2 id=\"methodology\" class=\"sv-h2\">How the engagement runs</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Threat models shape the build. The build gets attacked. The attack rewrites the threat model.</p></div><figure class=\"dg\" id=\"engagement-shape\"><svg class=\"dg-gantt\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 252\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Engagement shape for Cloud Security: 6 phases. Phase 1, Inventory, Week 1, inside the engagement window. Phase 2, Path analysis, Week 1–2, inside the engagement window, producing the identity graph with every privilege-escalation and lateral-movement path, as a diagram and as queryable data. Phase 3, Configuration review, Week 2, inside the engagement window, producing the configuration findings filtered to what is exploitable in your topology, with cis benchmark mapping. Phase 4, Detection gap analysis, Week 3, inside the engagement window, producing the detection coverage matrix against mitre att&amp;ck for cloud. Phase 5, Remediation plan, Week 3, inside the engagement window, producing the verification report after remediation. Phase 6, Verification, Week 6, inside the engagement window.\"><text class=\"dg-axisUnit\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\">weeks from kick-off</text><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"236\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"236\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text></g><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"403.3333333333333\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"403.3333333333333\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"403.3333333333333\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text></g><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"570.6666666666666\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"570.6666666666666\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"570.6666666666666\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text></g><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"738\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"738\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"738\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text></g><line class=\"dg-zero\" x1=\"236\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"232\"></line><text class=\"dg-zeroLabel\" x=\"236\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\">kick-off</text><text class=\"dg-colHead\" x=\"762\" y=\"16\">Drops out</text><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"65\">01</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"65\">Inventory</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"236\" y=\"53.5\" width=\"83.66666666666663\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"327.66666666666663\" y=\"64\">Week 1</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"64\">—</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\">02</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"95\">Path analysis</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"236\" y=\"83.5\" width=\"167.33333333333331\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"411.3333333333333\" y=\"94\">Week 1–2</text><line class=\"dg-leader\" x1=\"748\" y1=\"91\" x2=\"757\" y2=\"91\"></line><rect class=\"dg-artMark\" x=\"757\" y=\"87\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect><text class=\"dg-art\" x=\"771\" y=\"94\">Identity graph with every pri…</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"125\">03</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"125\">Configuration review</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"319.66666666666663\" y=\"113.5\" width=\"83.66666666666669\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"411.3333333333333\" y=\"124\">Week 2</text><line class=\"dg-leader\" x1=\"748\" y1=\"121\" x2=\"757\" y2=\"121\"></line><rect class=\"dg-artMark\" x=\"757\" y=\"117\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect><text class=\"dg-art\" x=\"771\" y=\"124\">Configuration findings filter…</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"155\">04</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"155\">Detection gap analysis</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"403.3333333333333\" y=\"143.5\" width=\"83.66666666666669\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"495\" y=\"154\">Week 3</text><line class=\"dg-leader\" x1=\"748\" y1=\"151\" x2=\"757\" y2=\"151\"></line><rect class=\"dg-artMark\" x=\"757\" y=\"147\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect><text class=\"dg-art\" x=\"771\" y=\"154\">Detection coverage matrix aga…</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"185\">05</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"185\">Remediation plan</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"403.3333333333333\" y=\"173.5\" width=\"83.66666666666669\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"495\" y=\"184\">Week 3</text><line class=\"dg-leader\" x1=\"748\" y1=\"181\" x2=\"757\" y2=\"181\"></line><rect class=\"dg-artMark\" x=\"757\" y=\"177\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect><text class=\"dg-art\" x=\"771\" y=\"184\">Verification report after rem…</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"215\">06</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"215\">Verification</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"654.3333333333334\" y=\"203.5\" width=\"83.66666666666663\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"646.3333333333334\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"end\">Week 6</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"214\">—</text></g></svg><div class=\"dg-ganttText\"><ol class=\"dg-sched\"><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">01</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Inventory</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Week 1</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">02</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Path analysis</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Week 1–2</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Identity graph with every privilege-escalation and lateral-movement path, as a diagram and as queryable data</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">03</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Configuration review</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Week 2</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Configuration findings filtered to what is exploitable in your topology, with CIS benchmark mapping</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">04</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Detection gap analysis</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Week 3</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Detection coverage matrix against MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Cloud</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">05</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Remediation plan</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Week 3</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Verification report after remediation</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">06</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Verification</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Week 6</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li></ol></div><figcaption class=\"dg-cap\"><ul class=\"dg-legend\"><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"before\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Before the window opens</li><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"window\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Inside the engagement window</li><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"after\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>After the report — a commitment, not an upsell</li><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"standing\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Standing work with no fixed window</li></ul><p class=\"dg-capNote\">Every bar is positioned and sized from that phase’s own stated schedule, converted to a single week axis and drawn to one scale. <!-- -->Nothing is rounded to make the picture tidier, and a phase whose schedule the service does not state — standing work, a quarterly cadence, anything open-ended — is drawn as a dotted row carrying its own words rather than handed a plausible-looking bar it never had.</p></figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-phaseStack\"><div class=\"stack\"><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">01 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Inventory</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Week 1</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Read-only role, full account enumeration, and the identity graph built from the actual policy documents rather than from the console summary.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">02 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Path analysis</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Week 1–2</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Trace privilege escalation and lateral movement paths. Each path gets a concrete narrative: this identity, this action, this result.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">03 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Configuration review</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Week 2</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Benchmark review against CIS and the relevant provider baseline, filtered to what is exploitable in your topology.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">04 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Detection gap analysis</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Week 3</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Replay representative attack techniques against your logging and show which ones produce a detectable signal today.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">05 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Remediation plan</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Week 3</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Ordered by path severity, with Terraform or Bicep for the fixes we recommend. A diff beats a recommendation.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">06 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Verification</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Week 6</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Re-run the graph after remediation and confirm the paths are closed rather than relocated.</p></div></article></div></div><p class=\"sv-note\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" href=\"/methodologies\"><span>Read the methodology — How we run an engagement</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"deliverables\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s6)\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Deliverables</p><h2 id=\"deliverables\" class=\"sv-h2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">Exactly what lands in your inbox</h2><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Walk a redacted sample before you buy one</a></p><div class=\"sv-deliverableArt\"><figure class=\"dg dg-stackFig\"><svg class=\"dg-stack\" viewBox=\"0 0 526 312\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"What lands in your inbox on a Cloud Security engagement: 5 deliverables. 1, Identity graph with every privilege-escalation and lateral-movement path, as a diagram and as queryable data, written document. 2, Configuration findings filtered to what is exploitable in your topology, with CIS benchmark mapping, written document. 3, Detection coverage matrix against MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Cloud, written document. 4, Infrastructure-as-code pull requests for the recommended fixes, in your repo. 5, Verification report after remediation, written report.\"><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"18\" y=\"18\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"18\" y=\"18\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"36\" y=\"38\">01</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"472\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written document</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"36\" y=\"56\">Identity graph with every privilege-escal…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"36\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"472\" y2=\"62\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"23\" y=\"64\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"23\" y=\"64\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"41\" y=\"84\">02</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"477\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written document</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"41\" y=\"102\">Configuration findings filtered to what i…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"41\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"477\" y2=\"108\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"28\" y=\"110\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"28\" y=\"110\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"46\" y=\"130\">03</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"482\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written document</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"46\" y=\"148\">Detection coverage matrix against MITRE A…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"46\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"482\" y2=\"154\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"33\" y=\"156\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"33\" y=\"156\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"51\" y=\"176\">04</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"487\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"end\">In your repo</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"51\" y=\"194\">Infrastructure-as-code pull requests for…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"51\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"487\" y2=\"200\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"38\" y=\"202\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"38\" y=\"202\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"56\" y=\"222\">05</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"492\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written report</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"56\" y=\"240\">Verification report after remediation</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"56\" y1=\"246\" x2=\"492\" y2=\"246\"></line></g></svg><figcaption class=\"dg-capNote dg-stackCap\">All 5 artefacts of a Cloud Security engagement, drawn in the order they arrive. Each is listed in full beside this.</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-ticks\" aria-label=\"Deliverables\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Identity graph with every privilege-escalation and lateral-movement path, as a diagram and as queryable data</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Configuration findings filtered to what is exploitable in your topology, with CIS benchmark mapping</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Detection coverage matrix against MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Cloud</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Infrastructure-as-code pull requests for the recommended fixes</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Verification report after remediation</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"accreditation\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Accreditation</p><h2 id=\"accreditation\" class=\"sv-h2\">Certifications</h2></div><ul class=\"sv-accred\"><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">ISO/IEC 27001:2022 — Information Security Management</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">UKAS-accredited certification body</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">SOC 2 Type II — Security, Availability, Confidentiality</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">Independent CPA firm</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">Cyber Essentials Plus — audited technical controls</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">IASME, on behalf of the NCSC</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">CREST member — penetration testing</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">CREST International</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">PCI QSA — qualified assessor company</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">PCI Security Standards Council</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/certifications\">Every certificate number and expiry date is published</a> · <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/trust\">Our own security posture</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"outcomes\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Outcomes</p><h2 id=\"outcomes\" class=\"sv-h2\">What changes afterwards</h2></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-ticks\" aria-label=\"Outcomes\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Privilege-escalation paths closed, not just buckets made private</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A remediation order based on reachability rather than vendor severity</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Terraform you can merge instead of advice you have to translate</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Known detection gaps, with the query that would close each one</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Evidence mapped to SOC 2, ISO 27001 and PCI DSS cloud requirements</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"team\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Who does the work</p><h2 id=\"team\" class=\"sv-h2\">The team on your engagement</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">One cloud security lead and one platform engineer who writes the infrastructure-as-code fixes.</p></div><div class=\"sv-expert\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Daniel Okafor\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:96px;height:96px;font-size:33px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(151 18% 22%), hsl(151 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">DO</span></div><div><h3 class=\"sv-expert__name\">Daniel Okafor</h3><p class=\"sv-expert__role\">Head of Detection &amp; Response</p><p class=\"sv-expert__bio\">Runs the managed detection service and the cloud security practice. Built and then dismantled three SIEM deployments before concluding that detection content matters more than the platform it runs on.</p><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-expert__certs-label\" id=\"certs-daniel-okafor\">Certifications</p><ul class=\"sv-chips\" aria-labelledby=\"certs-daniel-okafor\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">GIAC GCDA</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">GIAC GCIA</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">AWS Security Specialty</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">CISSP</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/about/leadership/daniel-okafor\">More about Daniel Okafor</a></p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"clients\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"clients\" class=\"u-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s6)\">Selected clients</h2><div class=\"marquee\" style=\"--gap:var(--s12);--marquee-dur:52s\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><ul class=\"marquee__track mq-track\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"related\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Related</p><h2 id=\"related\" class=\"sv-h2\">What usually goes with this</h2></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--2\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bug sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v-9\"></path><path d=\"M14 7a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v3a6 6 0 0 1-12 0v-3a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z\"></path><path d=\"M14.12 3.88 16 2\"></path><path d=\"M21 21a4 4 0 0 0-3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M21 5a4 4 0 0 1-3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M22 13h-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 21a4 4 0 0 1 3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 5a4 4 0 0 0 3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M6 13H2\"></path><path d=\"m8 2 1.88 1.88\"></path><path d=\"M9 7.13V6a3 3 0 1 1 6 0v1.13\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Manual, evidence-led testing with criticals reported the hour they are confirmed.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radar sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">24/7 detection and response on your telemetry, with detections written for your architecture.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-server sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"8\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><rect width=\"20\" height=\"8\" x=\"2\" y=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Reproducible infrastructure, short-lived pipeline identity, and a rehearsed rollback.</p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">Software Development</span></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scroll-text sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 12h-5\"></path><path d=\"M15 8h-5\"></path><path d=\"M19 17V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 21h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1a2 2 0 1 1-4 0V5a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, DORA and NIS2, evidenced from systems you already run.</p></div></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/software-development\">See everything under Software Development</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"engagement\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Commercials</p><h2 id=\"engagement\" class=\"sv-h2\">Shape, timeline and scoping</h2></div><dl class=\"sv-defs\"><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Timeline</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">3 weeks per cloud estate, verification at week 6.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Team shape</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">One cloud security lead and one platform engineer who writes the infrastructure-as-code fixes.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Engagement</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">Fixed-scope review, or continuous posture monitoring as part of an MDR retainer.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Scoping</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.<!-- --> <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\">How the four engagement models differ</a>.</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"faq\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Questions</p><h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"sv-h2\">Frequently asked</h2></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you need write access?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The review runs entirely from a read-only role you create and can delete afterwards — we supply the Terraform for it. Remediation arrives as pull requests against your infrastructure repository, which your team merges.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"We already run a CSPM tool. What does this add?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Your CSPM tool knows configurations; it does not know which of them are reachable from an identity an attacker could get. We ingest its findings, filter out the ones that are unexploitable in your topology, and add the path analysis it cannot do. Most clients see the finding count fall sharply and the remaining list become actionable.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does the identity graph take on a large estate?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Enumeration is automated and takes hours even across dozens of accounts. The analysis is the human part: three weeks covers an estate of up to roughly 40 accounts. Beyond that we scope by business unit.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you review Kubernetes specifically?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — RBAC, admission control, network policy, secrets handling, workload identity and the node-to-control-plane boundary. On managed clusters we also review the cloud identity attached to the node pool, which is where cluster compromise usually becomes account compromise.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does this cover multi-cloud?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, and the interesting findings are usually at the joins — the federated identity that lets a GitHub Actions workflow assume a role in AWS and a service principal in Azure, with nobody owning the trust boundary between them.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will you help us fix it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We write the infrastructure-as-code for the recommended fixes and raise them as pull requests. If you want the remediation delivered, our platform engineering practice does that as a separate engagement, and a different engineer verifies it.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"\"><div class=\"faq faq__accordion\" data-orientation=\"vertical\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_iulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_2ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Do you need write access?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_iulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_2ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_kulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_4ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>We already run a CSPM tool. What does this add?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_kulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_4ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_mulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_6ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>How long does the identity graph take on a large estate?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_mulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_6ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_oulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_8ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Can you review Kubernetes specifically?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_oulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_8ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_qulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_aulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Does this cover multi-cloud?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_qulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_aulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_sulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_culinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Will you help us fix it?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_sulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_culinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div></div><dl class=\"faq__nojs\"><div><dt>Do you need write access?</dt><dd>No. The review runs entirely from a read-only role you create and can delete afterwards — we supply the Terraform for it. Remediation arrives as pull requests against your infrastructure repository, which your team merges.</dd></div><div><dt>We already run a CSPM tool. What does this add?</dt><dd>Your CSPM tool knows configurations; it does not know which of them are reachable from an identity an attacker could get. We ingest its findings, filter out the ones that are unexploitable in your topology, and add the path analysis it cannot do. Most clients see the finding count fall sharply and the remaining list become actionable.</dd></div><div><dt>How long does the identity graph take on a large estate?</dt><dd>Enumeration is automated and takes hours even across dozens of accounts. The analysis is the human part: three weeks covers an estate of up to roughly 40 accounts. Beyond that we scope by business unit.</dd></div><div><dt>Can you review Kubernetes specifically?</dt><dd>Yes — RBAC, admission control, network policy, secrets handling, workload identity and the node-to-control-plane boundary. On managed clusters we also review the cloud identity attached to the node pool, which is where cluster compromise usually becomes account compromise.</dd></div><div><dt>Does this cover multi-cloud?</dt><dd>Yes, and the interesting findings are usually at the joins — the federated identity that lets a GitHub Actions workflow assume a role in AWS and a service principal in Azure, with nobody owning the trust boundary between them.</dd></div><div><dt>Will you help us fix it?</dt><dd>We write the infrastructure-as-code for the recommended fixes and raise them as pull requests. If you want the remediation delivered, our platform engineering practice does that as a separate engagement, and a different engineer verifies it.</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-h2\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Get started</p><h2 id=\"enquiry-h2\" class=\"sv-h2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p><p class=\"sv-note\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:var(--s2)\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>One cloud security lead and one platform engineer who writes the infrastructure-as-code fixes.</p></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><form class=\"sv-form\" id=\"enquiry-form\" action=\"\" encType=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_ID_403c44504416ed33d4af4350092b655f174641e336\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"returnTo\" value=\"/services/cloud-security\"/><div id=\"enquiry-incomplete\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>Some required fields came through empty. They are marked below — fill them in and send again.</p></div><div id=\"enquiry-email\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>That email address did not look complete. Check it and send again.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-name\">Your name<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-name\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"name\" name=\"name\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-email\">Business email<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-email\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"enq-email-help\" name=\"email\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-email-help\">We reply from a person, not a no-reply address.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-company\">Company<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-company\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"organization\" name=\"company\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-country\">Country<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-country\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"country-name\" aria-describedby=\"enq-country-help\" name=\"country\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-country-help\">Relevant for data residency and time zone.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-interest\">What is this about<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><select id=\"enq-interest\" name=\"interest\" class=\"sv-select\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\">Choose one</option><option value=\"penetration-testing\">Penetration testing</option><option value=\"application-security\">Application security programme</option><option value=\"cloud-security\" selected=\"\">Cloud security review</option><option value=\"grc-compliance\">SOC 2 / ISO 27001 / PCI DSS</option><option value=\"managed-detection-response\">Managed detection &amp; response</option><option value=\"red-teaming\">Red team</option><option value=\"vciso\">vCISO</option><option value=\"custom-software\">Custom software build</option><option value=\"web-application-development\">Web application</option><option value=\"platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</option><option value=\"business-systems\">ERP / CRM / HRM / LMS</option><option value=\"devsecops\">Secure SDLC — build and test together</option><option value=\"not-sure\">Not sure yet — help me work it out</option></select></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-message\">What are you trying to achieve, and what is the deadline<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"enq-message\" name=\"message\" class=\"sv-textarea\" rows=\"5\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-message-help\"></textarea><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-message-help\">Two or three sentences is plenty. The constraint is usually more useful than the requirement.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field sv-field--check\"><input id=\"enq-consent\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sv-check\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-consent-help\" name=\"consent\"/><span><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-consent\">I agree to Envenox contacting me about this enquiry.<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-consent-help\">We keep enquiry details for 24 months from last contact and never share them. See the privacy notice.</p></span></div><p class=\"sv-help\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sv-req\">*</span> <!-- -->Required.</p><div class=\"sv-form__actions\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\"><span>Send an enquiry</span></button><p class=\"sv-form__sla\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</p></div></form></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-cta-band\"><div><h2 class=\"sv-h2\">The identity graph, not the misconfiguration list.</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">Fixed-scope review, or continuous posture monitoring as part of an MDR retainer.</p></div><div class=\"sv-cta-band__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/case-studies\"><span>See the work</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Incident response — 24/7</span></span><span class=\"foot__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span><span class=\"foot__hotline-note\">Answered by a responder, 24/7. Median pickup under 4 minutes.</span></a></div><nav class=\"foot__cols\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Cybersecurity</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Software Development</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Applications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/erp\">ERP</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/crm\">CRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/hrm\">HRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/lms\">LMS</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/qa-automation\">QA &amp; Test Automation</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Company</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/locations\">Locations</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/partners\">Partners</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Proof &amp; Resources</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Sample Report</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li></ul></div></nav></div><div class=\"foot__mid\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Offices</h2><div class=\"foot__offices\"><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>London<!-- -->, <!-- -->United Kingdom</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Dhaka<!-- -->, <!-- -->Bangladesh</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">Level 7, Bay’s Galleria, Gulshan 1, Dhaka 1212</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>General enquiries</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:hello@envenox.com\">hello@envenox.com</a></p></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Security reports</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:security@envenox.com\">security@envenox.com</a></p></div></div></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Research notes</h2><form class=\"foot__form\" action=\"/api/newsletter\" method=\"post\"><label class=\"foot__form-label\" for=\"footer-newsletter-email\">Email address</label><div class=\"foot__form-row\"><input class=\"foot__input\" id=\"footer-newsletter-email\" type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footer-newsletter-hint\" name=\"email\"/><button class=\"foot__submit\" type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button></div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\" value=\"footer\"/><p class=\"foot__form-hint\" id=\"footer-newsletter-hint\">Advisories, teardowns and methodology notes. Roughly monthly. No sales sequence, one-click unsubscribe.</p></form></div></div><div class=\"foot__bottom\"><div class=\"foot__legal\"><p class=\"foot__legal-line\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Envenox Ltd<!-- -->. Registered in England and Wales. Registered office:<!-- --> <!-- -->1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT<!-- -->.</p><ul class=\"foot__legal-nav\"><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/privacy\">Privacy</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/cookies\">Cookies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/terms\">Terms</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/accessibility\">Accessibility</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/vulnerability-disclosure\">Vulnerability disclosure</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/sitemap\">Sitemap</a></li></ul></div><ul class=\"foot__social\"><li><a class=\"foot__social-link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/envenox\" rel=\"me noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>LinkedIn</span><span class=\"foot__vh\"> (opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"foot__social-link\" href=\"https://github.com/envenox\" rel=\"me noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g transform=\"translate(2.16