finding. A CI role that can assume a production deployment role that can read the KMS key that decrypts the customer database is an incident waiting for a leaked token, and no posture tool will rank it first.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"marginTop\":\"var(--s8)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"u-eyebrow\",\"style\":{\"marginBottom\":\"var(--s3)\"},\"id\":\"frameworks\",\"children\":\"Frameworks we work to\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-chips\",\"aria-label\":\"Frameworks and standards\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"CIS Benchmarks\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"style\",null,{\"href\":\"envenox-badge\",\"precedence\":\"default\",\"children\":\"$3d\"}],\"$L3e\"]}],\"$L3f\",\"$L40\",\"$L41\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]}]]\n42:T1fac,\n.dg {\n  /* POSITIONED ON PURPOSE. .dg-ganttText is clipped and absolutely positioned\n     at wide widths; an absolutely positioned element is only clipped by an\n     ancestor in its containing-block chain. Without this the clipped schedule\n     escapes and widens the page. */\n  position: relative;\n  margin: 0;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- the drawn schedule ---------------- */\n.dg-gantt { display: none; width: 100%; height: auto; overflow: visible; }\n@media (min-width: 860px) {\n  .dg-gantt { display: block; }\n}\n\n.dg-axisUnit,\n.dg-colHead {\n  font-family: var(--font-jetbrains-mono), ui-monospace, monospace;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  fill: var(--muted);\n}\n.dg-tick {\n  font-family: var(--font-jetbrains-mono), ui-monospace, monospace;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  fill: var(--muted);\n}\n.dg-grid { stroke: var(--border-strong); stroke-width: 1; }\n.dg-zero { stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.5; }\n.dg-zeroLabel {\n  font-family: var(--font-jetbrains-mono), ui-monospace, monospace;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  fill: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.dg-rowNum {\n  font-family: var(--font-jetbrains-mono), ui-monospace, monospace;\n  fo